{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"pro-有限集"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"pro-有限集"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>pro-有限集可定义为如下等价的概念:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完全不连通紧 Hausdorff 空间</li>\n<li>有限集范畴中的 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro-对象"}},{"Plain":"</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"Cantor集","text":"Cantor 集"}},{"Plain":" $\\prod_{\\mathbb N}\\{0,1\\}$</li>\n<li>$\\mathbb Z_p = \\lim_n \\mathbb Z/p^n$</li>\n<li>$\\mathbb N\\cup\\{\\infty\\}=\\lim_n \\{0,1,\\cdots,n\\}\\cup\\{\\infty\\}$</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"绝对Galois群","text":"绝对 Galois 群"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{Gal}(K^{\\mathrm{sep}}/K)=\\lim\\mathrm{Gal}(L/K)$</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p>pro-有限集之间的满射一定是商映射.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚态集合","text":"凝聚态集合"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}